Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The vendored Go sources are unmodified.

The Makefile in this directory currently carries an NVIDIA SPDX header. Its
content builds the go-acc binary itself (build.darwin / build.amd64) and
references none of this repository's build infrastructure, which is consistent
with it being the upstream go-acc Makefile rather than NVIDIA-authored glue.
That header is under review; if it is upstream, it will be removed.
